@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Create a book (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Hobbit",
  "author": "J. R. R. Tolkien",
  "price": 15.99
}

### Create another book (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pride and Prejudice",
  "author": "Jane Austen",
  "price": 10.5
}

### List books (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

### Search by partial title (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?search_q=Hobbit

### Sort by price, highest first (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?order_by=price&order=DESC

### Paginate results (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?limit=1&offset=0

### Filter by price range (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?min_price=10&max_price=20

### Invalid sort column (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?order_by=publisher

### Invalid book: missing title and non-numeric price (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Unknown Author",
  "price": "abc"
}

### Get book with ID 1 (expect 200 after creating the first book)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1

### Get missing book (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/99999

### Update book with ID 1 (expect 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Hobbit - Updated",
  "author": "J. R. R. Tolkien",
  "price": 18.5
}

### Update missing book (expect 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Missing Book",
  "author": "Nobody",
  "price": 5
}

### Delete book with ID 1 (expect 200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/1

### Delete missing book (expect 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/99999